  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "e5c74e0a-3325-44f2-b981-75d7c02e3564"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one solved binding of a scene; with an object name, reads that object out \
of it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"71b06230-2e60-462f-98de-579dc33b3c00"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
